// 2026-09-09 — the privacy statement was one accurate, unread 400-word paragraph,
// and a disclosure nobody reads is not a disclosure. These are the three questions
// a reader actually has, answered in one line each; the full text is one tap below,
// word for word unchanged. The footer line above them was rewritten for the same
// reason: "anonymous statistics are collected to improve this service (no personal
// data)" is a sentence that protests. Saying plainly what is recorded, and inviting
